# WQ Wholesale — Responsive Website

The public website was rebuilt to work on laptop, tablet, and mobile screens.

## Main files
- `index.html` — home page
- `products.html` — responsive category catalogue with filtering
- `about.html` — about page
- `contact.html` — contact page and validated front-end form
- `product-details.html` — responsive product-details template
- `404.html` — not-found page
- `css/style.css` — shared responsive styling
- `js/script.js` — mobile navigation, search, filtering, form validation, gallery, and reveal effects

## Test locally
Open `index.html` directly, or use the VS Code **Live Server** extension for the best result.

## Important publishing note
The contact form validates correctly in the browser, but it still needs to be connected to a real backend/email service before it can send messages.
